      "writtenOn": "2022-02-11T14:49:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027ve pulled changing the set to using \u0027fStaticFunctionName\u0027 forward from:\nhttps://skia-review.googlesource.com/c/skia/+/506879.\n\nMore generally - this is in flux. In particular, I\u0027ve been thinking ahead to the gradients and how I would like to emit\n   tilingHelper\n   colorMappingHelper\n   combiner\nand, then, if a tilingHelper and colorMappingHelper are used multiple times we would\u0027ve only emitted the code once. Still TBD how that would work though.",
      "parentUuid": "6a90d388_67317685",
      "range": {
