        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-11T20:12:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If those are each entries, that should just work out, right? The SkGradientShader would be mapped on to a composition of snippet entries, we don\u0027t have to necessarily require that all built-in effects map to a single snippet, right?",
      "parentUuid": "b68a0750_83fd764a",
