        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-02-10T21:36:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we expect to need other procedurally generated sksls?\n\nIf we don\u0027t, then maybe this should be folded into SkShaderCodeDictionary vs. being stored per snippet entry?\n\nIf we do, but for a limited scenario like one per backend, or one for static/built-in snippets and another for runtime sksl, maybe we configure them as fields on the code dictionary or \"ProgramBuilder\"?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 157,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 157,
        "endChar": 43
      },
      "revId": "b8a9a75094357cd713045fe0674dbe00d7a86cae",
